Build:
cd build && cmake .. -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/opt/qt/6.10.0/gcc_64 && cmake --build .

Or if you've already configured once, just:
cd build && cmake --build .

Then run the app with:
./orvocapp

In the project dir: 

./generate-deb.sh

sudo dpkg -i ./build/{filename}.deb

run: orvocapp

Note: 
If any old icons still appear after using new icons, you may need to run: 
sudo rm ~/.local/share/icons/hicolor/*/apps/orvocapp.png

To uninstall: sudo dpkg -r orvocapp

